{"appleMusic":"https://music.apple.com/gb/station/episode-535/ra.1603664632","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-535"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #535","artwork":"images/episodes/soulection-radio-show-535.jpg","content":"House music for the soul with a classic cool down.\n<!--more-->\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2022-01-15T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"K84Y1Wjwlno","position":17,"timestamp":"00:57:44","rawTrack":"Jay Daniel - Aja","track":{"id":"LmFsH0oUrdM","path":"/artists/jay-daniel/tracks/aja/","slug":"aja","title":"Aja","artist":{"slug":"jay-daniel","title":"Jay Daniel"},"artwork":"images/artists/jay-daniel/tracks/aja.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"zk5-UKG1jDY","slug":"535","tags":[6,3,6,15],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://music.apple.com/gb/station/episode-535/ra.1603664632","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-535"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #535","artwork":"images/episodes/soulection-radio-show-535.jpg","content":"House music for the soul with a classic cool down.\n<!--more-->\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2022-01-15T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"4KxEGZ6KmKg","position":8,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Jay Daniel - I Have No Name","track":{"id":"2TzATvAFUAA","path":"/artists/jay-daniel/tracks/i-have-no-name/","slug":"i-have-no-name","title":"I Have No Name","artist":{"slug":"jay-daniel","title":"Jay Daniel"},"artwork":"images/artists/jay-daniel/tracks/i-have-no-name.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"7vHj7jlvMRk","slug":"156","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-156-w-j"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #156 w/ J-Louis","artwork":"/images/episodes/156.jpg","content":"Joe Kay is joined by Soulection's very own iPhone producer J-Louis.\n\n<!--more-->\nAs some of you may or may not know, J-Louis produces all his music on the iPhone [(Nano Studio App)](https://apps.apple.com/gb/developer/blip-interactive-ltd/id382263654?at=1010lMz4). He even put out a free EP with us in the beginning of the year entitled [\"Balanced\"](https://soulection.bandcamp.com/album/balanced-ep) which was also produced entirely on the iPhone. This 20 year-old from Azusa, CA is really a special guy who we feel is going to be BIG in the near future as long as he stays on track with his progression.\n\nJ-Louis played an exclusive set for a little over 30 minutes with all his recent unreleased productions and then chopped it up with us about his musical background (Drummer since he was 8 years-old & played in a Hardcore band & toured when he was 12) and how he purchased a stolen Macbook Pro (without knowing) to start producing on a computer that was eventually stolen -- forcing him to produce on his iPhone again. \n\nWhat a journey! Joe Kay also made sure to talk about his experience at the Yeezus tour this past Friday and later went into a heavy discussion about rumors of Soulection being part of Free-masonry/Illuminati. Very interesting and informative conversations going on as always.\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10844,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-12-14T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":3}},{"id":"4N6cL8ERHDI","position":30,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Jay Daniel - 1001 Nights","track":{"id":"cOev19nZGGs","path":"/artists/jay-daniel/tracks/1001-nights/","slug":"1001-nights","title":"1001 Nights","artist":{"slug":"jay-daniel","title":"Jay Daniel"},"artwork":"images/artists/jay-daniel/tracks/1001-nights.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"ie6DZYqhgIE","slug":"288","tags":[6,3,6,15],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://music.apple.com/gb/station/episode-288/ra.1181220374","soundcloud":"ht